<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>4 yome boss oma 💛</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg, #fffde7, #fff59d, #ffd54f
  );
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 25px 12px;
}

.card {
  background: #fffef5;
  max-width: 650px;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 35px 25px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #b8860b44;
  border: 2px solid #ffe082;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.sunflower {
  font-size: 65px;
  animation: bounce 2s infinite;
}

h1 {
  color: #c58b00;
  font-size: 32px;
}

.subtitle {
  color: #a67c00;
  font-style: italic;
}

button {
  border: none;
  background: #ffca28;
  color: #654500;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 15px 25px;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin: 15px 0;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
  background: #ffb300;
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

#letter {
  display: none;
  text-align: left;
  margin-top: 25px;
  padding: 22px;
  background: #fff9df;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border-left: 5px solid #fbc02d;
  animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease;
}

#letter p {
  color: #655020;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.signature {
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #b8860b !important;
}

.heart {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: -40px;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 3;
  animation: floatUp 5s linear forwards;
}

@keyframes bounce {
  50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(15px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

@keyframes floatUp {
  to {
    transform: translateY(-110vh);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">
  <div class="sunflower">🌻</div>

  <h1>Happy Birthday, Yome! 💛</h1>

  <p class="subtitle">
    My goated birthday message as the boss oma malopit walang katuad.
  </p>

  <button id="openButton" onclick="openLetter()">
    Open IT OPEN OPEN 💛💜
  </button>

  <div id="letter">

    <p>
      another year of youuu!! and I hope you know
      how lucky we are to have someone like you in
      our lives. sana nakikita mo rin sa sarili mo
      kung gaano ka ka-special, because you deserve
      to be appreciated more than you know.
      you are worth everything, yome ko, and I hope
      you never let the things happening around you
      make you question that.
    </p>

    <p>
      I know life hasn't always been easy for you.
      alam kong marami kang pinagdaanan na hindi
      naman lahat alam ng mga tao sa paligid mo.
      but look at you now!! despite everything,
      you're still here, still growing, and still
      working towards the things that you want to
      achieve. I am SOFER DUPER MEGA ULTRA GALACTIC
      PROUD OF YOUUU YOME! Hindi naging madali lahat,
      but you still managed to get through those
      days. and I hope you give yourself enough
      credit for that because you deserve to be
      proud of yourself, too.
    </p>

    <p>
      you spend so much time understanding and
      caring for other people, but I hope you give
      yourself that same love and understanding,
      too.I hope this new chapter brings you closer
      to all the dreams you've been working so hard
      for. sana makuha mo lahat ng pinagdarasal at
      pinaghihirapan mo. I hope you meet people who
      will genuinely appreciate you, people who will
      make you feel that you never have to question
      your worth, and people who will love you
      exactly as you are. walang labis, walang
      kulang, may pa-sobra pa dahil special ka 😌
    </p>

    <p>
      I also want you to know that even though
      things have changed and our trio didn't work
      out the way we once hoped it would, it doesn't
      mean that I stopped caring or appreciating
      you. things may not be the same anymore,
      but please know that you still have me.
      I'll always be rooting for you, celebrating
      your achievements, and wishing you nothing
      but the best. kahit gaano pa karami ang
      magbago, I'll always be happy to see you grow
      and become the person you've always wanted
      to be.
    </p>

    <p class="signature">
      happiest birthday, babee! 💛
      u da goat always i lovee youu!!
    </p>

    <div style="text-align:center;font-size:35px">
      🌻💛✨🌼💛
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<script>
function openLetter() {
  const letter = document.getElementById("letter");
  const button = document.getElementById("openButton");

  letter.style.display = "block";
  button.style.display = "none";

  for (let i = 0; i < 35; i++) {
    setTimeout(createHeart, i * 120);
  }
}

function createHeart() {
  const heart = document.createElement("div");
  heart.className = "heart";
  heart.textContent = "💛";

  heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
  heart.style.fontSize =
    (15 + Math.random() * 25) + "px";

  document.body.appendChild(heart);

  setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 5000);
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
